d hands`. Under the settled default **Balanced** mode for `create`, new independent props such as a screwdriver/tools are not permitted, and the extra scene/presentation details go beyond what was requested. |\n","selection":[],"clarification":"evals/reviews/2026-09-22-phase-four-review-clarification-01.json","reviewed_at":"2026-09-23T02:17:40.987Z"}
